    {
      "id": "legacy-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 104,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 667123812,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791455627721,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BEFORE: ONE BIG PROCESSOR\n\nPaymentProcessor.processPayment(type)\n  if type == \"Card\"  -> card logic\n  else if type == \"PayPal\" -> PayPal logic\n  else if type == \"Crypto\" -> crypto logic\n  else -> unsupported\n\nThe processor both chooses AND performs\neach payment. More methods mean more branches.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 19,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "BEFORE: ONE BIG PROCESSOR\n\nPaymentProcessor.processPayment(type)\n  if type == \"Card\"  -> card logic\n  else if type == \"PayPal\" -> PayPal logic\n  else if type == \"Crypto\" -> crypto logic\n  else -> unsupported\n\nThe processor both chooses AND performs\neach payment. More methods mean more branches.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a3"
    },
    {
